WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:06.620
Does a plant really need sunlight if it already has water?

2
00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:08.740
Ask your child for a guess.

3
00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:14.120
A fair test is a test where only one thing changes and everything else stays the

4
00:00:14.120 --> 00:00:17.640
same. Four cups of radish seedlings can show you how.

5
00:00:18.583 --> 00:00:20.963
First, grow all four cups the same way.

6
00:00:21.823 --> 00:00:25.203
Same soil, same cups, same seeds, all on a sunny windowsill.

7
00:00:26.163 --> 00:00:28.783
Wait until most seedlings are about two centimetres tall.

8
00:00:29.703 --> 00:00:33.123
Before you change anything, ask your child what will happen to each cup.

9
00:00:33.983 --> 00:00:35.043
Write or draw the guesses.

10
00:00:35.983 --> 00:00:37.443
The safety notes are on the page.

11
00:00:38.467 --> 00:00:39.767
Now change things.

12
00:00:40.667 --> 00:00:42.967
Move two cups into the cupboard, where it is dark.

13
00:00:43.867 --> 00:00:44.987
Two cups keep their water.

14
00:00:45.667 --> 00:00:46.827
Two get nothing more.

15
00:00:47.687 --> 00:00:48.687
Change nothing else.

16
00:00:49.487 --> 00:00:53.647
Next to the light and water cup, the dark and water cup differs only in light.

17
00:00:54.447 --> 00:00:56.827
The light, no water cup differs only in water.

18
00:00:57.850 --> 00:00:59.070
Now look and compare.

19
00:01:00.090 --> 00:01:01.890
Check every day or two, and draw each cup.

20
00:01:02.690 --> 00:01:06.130
The cups with no water usually droop within two to five days.

21
00:01:07.050 --> 00:01:11.470
Within about a week, the watered seedlings in the dark are often taller, thinner and

22
00:01:11.470 --> 00:01:15.210
paler. The cup with light and water stays green and upright.

23
00:01:16.233 --> 00:01:17.953
Look again at the dark seedlings.

24
00:01:18.893 --> 00:01:19.893
They are the tallest.

25
00:01:20.573 --> 00:01:22.073
Your child may call them the best.

26
00:01:22.853 --> 00:01:25.253
So ask about colour and strength, not only height.

27
00:01:26.033 --> 00:01:28.633
A seedling in the dark stretches on food it has stored.

28
00:01:29.553 --> 00:01:31.593
Once that food runs out, it grows weaker.

29
00:01:32.653 --> 00:01:33.733
Height alone is not health.

30
00:01:34.493 --> 00:01:38.413
If a result surprises your child, it is still real, so do not throw it out.

31
00:01:39.366 --> 00:01:43.346
If your child wants extra water for one cup, do not change that cup.

32
00:01:44.206 --> 00:01:47.626
Add an extra cup to try the idea, and the first test stays fair.

33
00:01:48.566 --> 00:01:49.726
Here is the short version.

34
00:01:50.866 --> 00:01:53.546
Predict first. Change one thing at a time.

35
00:01:54.386 --> 00:01:55.766
Keep everything else the same.

36
00:01:56.726 --> 00:01:59.666
Look and compare. Keep every real result.
